# Build context sent to Fly's remote builder. COPY in the Dockerfile is
# explicit, so nothing here is actually copied into the image -- but the whole
# context is still uploaded, and that includes .env. Keeping it out means the
# API keys never leave this machine on the way to a build server.
.git
.env
.env.*
.netlify
.venv
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
node_modules
tests
